//  - Replace division by 9 with multiplication by a precomputed reciprocal.
//  - Add 2D spatial blocking (tiling) in i and j using into_blocks_dynamic.
//    The resulting iteration order is equivalent to lexicographic (i,j),
//    so Gauss–Seidel dependencies are preserved.
//  - Still use Noarr traverser and state-based neighbor access, so the
